{
  "_comment": [
    "What the guest needs to exist inside the emulator, and where the page",
    "fetches it from.  Every URL points at a file this repository already",
    "carries, so the demo adds no copies: GitHub Pages serves the same bytes",
    "that setup.sh unpacks locally.",
    "",
    "Two groups, because the two halves of VOICEVOX cost very different things.",
    "Text analysis needs glibc, CORE and the dictionary, answers in about a",
    "second, and is 33 MB.  Synthesis needs the ONNX Runtime and the voice model",
    "on top - another 76 MB - and then takes a very long time, because a neural",
    "vocoder on an interpreted CPU is what it is.",
    "",
    "The seven shared libraries are exactly what the dynamic loader opens -",
    "traced with X86EMU_TRACE_OPEN=1 - and not the whole Debian sysroot, which",
    "is mostly headers and static archives that no run ever touches.",
    "",
    "`bytes` only sizes the progress bar."
  ],
